  <History Date="12-09-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (poor documentation.  vague.  no pixel layout - guessed)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="19-01-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Vshine Pixel Strobe Bar IP (QT-SLB1008P) (hopeless documentation.  mostly nonsense.  effectively identical.  145 channel mode just details 48x white and 32x RGB but specs have 32x 0.5W 5050, 16x 1W yellow and 32x 1W white.  left as 16x golden 'GODEN' in charts.. +32x white+32x RGB for now)" Version="1" />
